stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> in_progress
    in_progress --> in_progress: prompt / Skill / tool / 中间失败
    in_progress --> completed: SessionEnd + 有效完成证据
    in_progress --> interrupted: SessionEnd 无完成证据
    in_progress --> cancelled: 任务切换或用户取消
    interrupted --> in_progress: 新会话满足接续条件
    cancelled --> in_progress: 新任务重新开始
    completed --> completed: 重复上报 / 旧 in_progress 到达
